{"tempoGasto":11,"totalRegistros":1,"registros":[{"registro":{"txtEmentaHighlight":"\u003chtml\u003e\n \u003chead\u003e\n  \u003cstyle\u003e\n      \u003c!--\n      --\u003e\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n \u003c/head\u003e\n \u003cbody\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan\u003e Recurso de Revista a que se dá provimento parcial, para deferir a repercussão da gratificação semestral no 13º salário, com apoio na Súmula 78, desta Corte. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e","inteiroTeorHTMLHighlight":"\u003chtml\u003e\n \u003chead\u003e\n  \u003cstyle\u003e\n      \u003c!--\n      --\u003e\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n \u003c/head\u003e\n \u003cbody\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e A C Ó R D Ã O \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e (Ac. 1ª T-02906/85) \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e JW/lft \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Recurso de Revista a que se dá provimento parcial, para deferir a repercussão da gratificação semestral no 13º salário, com apoio na Súmula 78, desta Corte. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Vistos, relatados e discutidos estes autos de Recurso de Revista Nº TST-RR-3823/84, em que é Recorrente DANILO HUEBL e Recorrido BANCO ITAÚ S/A. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \"O Regional (fls. 150) entendeu que a gratificação semestral corresponde à liberalidade da empresa e, por este motivo não reflete no 13º salário, férias e aviso prévio. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e No tocante à jornada, o TRT não considerou as 7ª e 8ª horas trabalhadas como extras dado que o reclamante exercia cargo de confiança enquadrável no § 2º, do art. 224 da CLT. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Recorre de revista o empregado (fls. 156), sustentando que a gratificação semestral tem reflexos nas férias, aviso prévio e 13º salário. Indica atrito com a Súmula 78. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Quanto à jornada de trabalho, o empregado alega que o Banco não provou que o reclamante tinha poder de mando ou decisão e mais ainda, a comissão de cargo que o empregado recebia era inferior a 1/3 do salário do cargo efetivo, pois o Banco não computava no salário a verba de adicional de tempo de serviço, nem a média das comissões \"mercap\" e \"merseg\". Acosta divergência (fls. 157/64). \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Contra-razões do Banco (fls. 170), a douta Procuradoria-Geral, pelo parecer do Dr. Sebastião Vieira dos Sanros, opina pelo provimento (fls. 176).\" \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e É O RELATÓRIO, na forma regimental. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e V O T O \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Das 7ª e 8ª horas como extras e reflexos. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e A decisão revisanda, de acordo com as provas dos autos, entendeu que o reclamante exercia cargo de confiança, estando enquadrado no § 2º do art. 224 consolidado e, para se chegar a conclusão diversa, seria necessário o reexame do conjunto probatório, vedado nesta esfera recursal, a teor do que dispõe a Súmula 126, desta Corte, razão pela qual NÃO CONHEÇO no particular. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Diferenças de aviso prévio, férias, 13º salário, face a média das gratificações semestrais. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e CONHEÇO pela divergência de fls. 158. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e M É R I T O \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Quanto às diferenças de aviso prévio e férias pela média das gratificações semestrais. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Tendo em vista que tais parcelas integram o salário do obreiro e sobre elas tenham sido calculadas tais gratificações, não há que se deferir nova repercussão, sob pena de se incorrer em \"bis in idem\". \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Assim é que, NEGO PROVIMENTO neste ponto. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e No que pertine a repercussão das gratificações semestrais no 13º salário, razão assiste ao reclamante, face o que dispõe a Súmula 78, desta Corte. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Por todo o exposto, DOU PROVIMENTO PARCIAL ao recurso do reclamante para, reformando o v. acórdão hostilizado, deferir-lhe a repercussão da gratificação semestral no 13º salário. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e I S T O P O S T O \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e ACORDAM os Ministros da 1ª Turma do Tribunal Superior do Trabalho, unanimemente, conhecer da revista, e, no mérito, por maioria, dar-lhe provimento, em parte, para deferir a repercussão da gratificação semestral, no 13º salário, vencido o Exmo Sr. Ministro Ildélio Martins, relator. Redigirá o acórdão o Exmº Sr. Ministro João Wagner, revisor. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Brasília, 27 de junho de 1985. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e MARCO AURÉLIO MENDES DE FARIAS MELLO \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Presidente \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e JOÃO WAGNER \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Redator Designado \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Ciente: \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e JOÃO PEDRO FERRAZ DOS PASSOS \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp class\u003d\"default\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e Procurador \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e","id":"a18d31ee61eb33ab8e88b300a2551823","numero":"00038231119845555555","tipo":{"codigoTipoJurisprudencia":"ACORDAO","nome":"Acordão"},"orgaoJudicante":{"codigo":69,"descricao":"1ª Turma"},"orgao":{"numero":0,"nome":"Tribunal Superior do Trabalho","sigla":"TST"},"numProcInt":26,"anoProcInt":1984,"numProc":3823,"anoProc":1984,"codFase":"RR","dtaFase":"1985-08-22","indTipAcordao":"R","dtaJulgamento":"1985-06-27","numFormatado":" - 3823-11.1984.5.55.5555","numInterno":229674,"dtaPublicacao":"1985-08-23","dtaOrdenacao":"1985-08-23","dtaAtualizacao":"2026-04-27T12:22:30-03","codMinRelator":"GMJW","nomRelator":"joao wagner","sexRelator":"M","ementaHtml":"removido no backend","ementa":"Recurso de Revista a que se dá provimento parcial, para deferir a repercussão da gratificação semestral no 13º salário, com apoio na Súmula 78, desta Corte.","ementaNaoAnalisada":"removido no backend","txtInteiroTeor":"removido no backend","txtInteiroTeorNaoAnalisado":"removido no backend","inteiroTeorHtml":"\u003chtml\u003e\n  \u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n      \u003c!--\n      --\u003e\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n  \u003c/head\u003e\n  \u003cbody\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        A C Ó R D Ã O\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        (Ac. 1ª T-02906/85)\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        JW/lft\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Recurso de Revista a que se dá provimento parcial, para deferir a repercussão da \n        gratificação semestral no 13º salário, com apoio na Súmula 78, desta Corte.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Vistos, relatados e discutidos estes autos de Recurso de Revista Nº TST-RR-3823/84, em que \n        é Recorrente DANILO HUEBL e Recorrido BANCO ITAÚ S/A.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \"O Regional (fls. 150) entendeu que a gratificação semestral corresponde à liberalidade da \n        empresa e, por este motivo não reflete no 13º salário, férias e aviso prévio.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        No tocante à jornada, o TRT não considerou as 7ª e 8ª horas trabalhadas como extras dado \n        que o reclamante exercia cargo de confiança enquadrável no § 2º, do art. 224 da CLT.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Recorre de revista o empregado (fls. 156), sustentando que a gratificação semestral tem \n        reflexos nas férias, aviso prévio e 13º salário. Indica atrito com a Súmula 78.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Quanto à jornada de trabalho, o empregado alega que o Banco não provou que o reclamante \n        tinha poder de mando ou decisão e mais ainda, a comissão de cargo que o empregado recebia \n        era inferior a 1/3 do salário do cargo efetivo, pois o Banco não computava no salário a \n        verba de adicional de tempo de serviço, nem a média das comissões \"mercap\" e \"merseg\". \n        Acosta divergência (fls. 157/64). \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Contra-razões do Banco (fls. 170), a douta Procuradoria-Geral, pelo parecer do Dr. \n        Sebastião Vieira dos Sanros, opina pelo provimento (fls. 176).\"\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        É O RELATÓRIO, na forma regimental.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        V O T O\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Das 7ª e 8ª horas como extras e reflexos.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        A decisão revisanda, de acordo com as provas dos autos, entendeu que o reclamante exercia \n        cargo de confiança, estando enquadrado no § 2º do art. 224 consolidado e, para se chegar a \n        conclusão diversa, seria necessário o reexame do conjunto probatório, vedado nesta esfera \n        recursal, a teor do que dispõe a Súmula 126, desta Corte, razão pela qual NÃO CONHEÇO no \n        particular.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Diferenças de aviso prévio, férias, 13º salário, face a média das gratificações semestrais.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        CONHEÇO pela divergência de fls. 158.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        M É R I T O\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Quanto às diferenças de aviso prévio e férias pela média das gratificações semestrais.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Tendo em vista que tais parcelas integram o salário do obreiro e sobre elas tenham sido \n        calculadas tais gratificações, não há que se deferir nova repercussão, sob pena de se \n        incorrer em \"bis in idem\".\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Assim é que, NEGO PROVIMENTO neste ponto.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        No que pertine a repercussão das gratificações semestrais no 13º salário, razão assiste ao \n        reclamante, face o que dispõe a Súmula 78, desta Corte.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Por todo o exposto, DOU PROVIMENTO PARCIAL ao recurso do reclamante para, reformando o v. \n        acórdão hostilizado, deferir-lhe a repercussão da gratificação semestral no 13º salário.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        I S T O  P O S T O\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        ACORDAM os Ministros da 1ª Turma do Tribunal Superior do Trabalho, unanimemente, conhecer \n        da revista, e, no mérito, por maioria, dar-lhe provimento, em parte, para deferir a \n        repercussão da gratificação semestral, no 13º salário, vencido o Exmo Sr. Ministro Ildélio \n        Martins, relator. Redigirá o acórdão o Exmº Sr. Ministro João Wagner, revisor.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Brasília, 27 de junho de 1985.\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        MARCO AURÉLIO MENDES DE FARIAS MELLO\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Presidente\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        JOÃO WAGNER \n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Redator Designado\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Ciente:\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        JOÃO PEDRO FERRAZ DOS PASSOS\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n    \u003cp class\u003ddefault\u003e\n      \u003cspan style\u003d\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Courier New\"\u003e\n        Procurador\n      \u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","inteiroTeorRtf":"removido no backend","dispositivo":"unanimemente, conhecer da revista, e, no mérito, por maioria, dar-lhe provimento, em parte, para deferir a repercussão da gratificação semestral, no 13º salário, vencido o Exmo Sr. Ministro Ildélio Martins, relator. Redigirá o acórdão o Exmº Sr. Ministro João Wagner, revisor.","dispositivoNaoAnalisado":"removido no backend","numeracaoUnica":{"numero":3823,"digito":11,"ano":1984,"orgao":5,"tribunal":55,"vara":5555},"numeracaoAnterior":{"numero":3823,"ano":1984,"vara":0},"numFormatadoAnt":"RR - 3823/1984.0","numProcDocumento":0},"destaques":{}}],"agregacoes":[{"nome":"tiposJurisprudencia","mapaTermoQuantidade":{"ACORDAO":1},"respostasSubAgregacoes":{}}]}